      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A company must first verify the identity of the requester to ensure they are who they claim to be. If the request is valid, the company must then assess if there are any overriding legal obligations that prevent erasure, like for financial records. If no such exceptions exist, the company must erase the personal data without undue delay, typically within one month. Finally, they must inform the user that the data has been deleted, or explain why it could not be deleted.",
