    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. what about edge cases though? like, if we have data that's tucked away in old backups or secondary logs that aren't immediately visible, do we still have to find and scrub everything, or is there some leeway there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
